5,1,1,talk,Asuka,,We need to verify the financial exposure before committing to any location.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Shion,,Sleep quality dictates performance. I need data on the actual sleeping conditions.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Minato,,I am worried about the workload. Last year was exhausting for the organizers.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Misaki,,The account deficit from last year is still unresolved. I need to see the costs.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Takumi,,The year-groups are isolated. I want to know how the venue affects social mixing.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Misaki, if we pick a place with hidden costs, the deficit grows.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Shion,,"@Minato, if the organizers are burned out, the camp fails. I agree.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Minato,,I just want to make sure we don't repeat last year's mistakes.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Misaki,,I will look into the rate sheets and the transport receipts.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Takumi,,I will check the seniors' views and the attendance sheets from past camps.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Asuka,,I will investigate the whole-building let terms and the public booking lottery.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Shion,,I will look at the inland club accounts and the prefecture rate sheet.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Minato,,I will check the canteen closure info and the vacation timetable for our hall.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Misaki,,Agreed. Let's see what the numbers say before we argue about feelings.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Takumi,,"If the attendance is low, the social goal is already dead.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
