35,2,1,talk,Asuka,,The whole-building let is a trap. Non-refundable deposits mean we pay for no-shows.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Shion,,Inland centres are eight to a room with lights out at eleven. Unacceptable.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Minato,,Our own hall is booked by three other clubs. We can't train continuously there.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Misaki,,"Transport is 38% of the cost if we go far. The public beds are cheap, but the travel eats it.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Takumi,,The seniors say mixing only happens if we sleep together. But a fifth never show up.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Misaki, the transport cost is the killer. We need a local option or a very cheap one.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Shion,,"@Takumi, if a fifth don't come, the social experiment is moot. But the sleep issue remains.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Minato,,Cooking duty took two hours a day last year. I don't want to do that again.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Misaki,,"The public rate is 1,100 yen. It's fixed. But the transport variance is huge.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Takumi,,"If we stay local, the first-train times mean a third can't make it by nine.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Asuka,,"The lottery for public centers is a nightmare. Nine pages, resubmit if dates shift.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Shion,,The coastal lodge offers a whole building. But the deposit risk is high.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Minato,,The canteen is closed. We have to cook or eat out. Cooking is too much work.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Misaki,,"If we go coastal, the transport is high. If we go inland, the sleep is bad.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Takumi,,The attendance data is grim. But the seniors are right about the evenings.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
