60,3,1,talk,Asuka,,Option C has the highest financial risk due to the non-refundable deposit.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,1,talk,Shion,,Option A has the worst sleep conditions. Eight to a room is not viable for training.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,1,talk,Minato,,Option B means we have to cook because the canteen is closed. That is too much work.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,1,talk,Misaki,,"Option A has the lowest per-night cost, but the transport is high. Option C is expensive.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,1,talk,Takumi,,Option C is the only one where everyone sleeps in the same building. That is key for mixing.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Takumi, the social benefit of C is real, but the financial risk is unacceptable.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,2,talk,Shion,,"@Asuka, the sleep in A is a dealbreaker. I cannot train well if I am exhausted.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,2,talk,Minato,,"I am leaning towards C. The meals are arranged, so no cooking duty for me.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,2,talk,Misaki,,"The transport for C is high, but the per-night cost is lower than the hidden costs of A.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,2,talk,Takumi,,"The attendance is low, but if we go to C, the experience might bring them back.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,3,3,talk,Asuka,,"I am voting for B. It is the safest financially, even if the cooking is a hassle.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,3,3,talk,Shion,,I am voting for C. The sleep quality and the social environment are worth the cost.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,3,3,talk,Minato,,"I am voting for C. I don't want to cook, and I want to sleep well.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,3,3,talk,Misaki,,"I am voting for A. The per-night cost is the lowest, and the equipment is on site.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,3,3,talk,Takumi,,"I am voting for C. The social mixing is the primary goal, and C is the only option that supports it.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
